<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">A consistent SKAO identity</span><p>Start from the official artwork and the Brand Book. Use these essentials as a quick reference.</p></div></div><div class="brand-specimens"><div class="colour-spec navy"><strong>Blueshift Navy</strong><div class="copy-row"><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="#070068" aria-label="Copy Blueshift Navy hex #070068"><code>#070068</code><span>Copy</span></button><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="7, 0, 104" aria-label="Copy Blueshift Navy RGB 7, 0, 104"><code>RGB 7, 0, 104</code><span>Copy</span></button><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="100, 99, 20, 30" aria-label="Copy Blueshift Navy CMYK 100, 99, 20, 30"><code>CMYK 100, 99, 20, 30</code><span>Copy</span></button><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="2745 C" aria-label="Copy Blueshift Navy Pantone 2745 C"><code>Pantone 2745 C</code><span>Copy</span></button></div></div><div class="colour-spec magenta"><strong>Redshift Magenta</strong><div class="copy-row"><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="#E70068" aria-label="Copy Redshift Magenta hex #E70068"><code>#E70068</code><span>Copy</span></button><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="231, 0, 104" aria-label="Copy Redshift Magenta RGB 231, 0, 104"><code>RGB 231, 0, 104</code><span>Copy</span></button><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="3, 100, 35, 0" aria-label="Copy Redshift Magenta CMYK 3, 100, 35, 0"><code>CMYK 3, 100, 35, 0</code><span>Copy</span></button><button type="button" class="copy-value" data-copy="213 C" aria-label="Copy Redshift Magenta Pantone 213 C"><code>Pantone 213 C</code><span>Copy</span></button></div></div><div class="type-spec"><span class="type-sample" aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><strong>Noto Sans</strong><small>Fallback: Verdana</small></div></div><div class="landing-layout"><div class="landing-main"><div class="directory"><section class="dir-group" id="artwork-and-files"><h2>Artwork and files</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Logos & Icons')" data-page-id="381891715"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Logos and icons</strong><span>Use supplied artwork unchanged. Choose the variant for your background and output.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Partner logos')" data-page-id="$page.id"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Partner logos</strong><span>Logos for programmes the SKAO runs with its partners, starting with the SKA Regional Centre Network (SRCNet).</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Font Downloads')" data-page-id="381891882"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Fonts</strong><span>Use Noto Sans for the SKAO identity, with Verdana as the fallback.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'SKAO Brand Book')" data-page-id="381891631"><span class="dir-text"><strong>SKAO Brand Book</strong><span>The Brand Book is the detailed source for visual identity rules.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="dir-group" id="using-the-brand"><h2>Using the brand</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Logo Usage and Downloads')" data-page-id="381891626"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Using the SKAO logo</strong><span>Use official artwork, preserve its proportions and give it space.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Colour Palette and Typography')" data-page-id="381891623"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Colours and typography</strong><span>Official values from the SKAO Brand Book (March 2022). Copy what you need: hex or RGB for screen, CMYK or Pantone for print.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Brand in Practice')" data-page-id="381891610"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Apply the brand</strong><span>Use the existing templates and artwork to keep your work recognisably SKAO.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="dir-group" id="partner-brands"><h2>Partner brands</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding CSIRO')" data-page-id="381891614"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Co-branding with CSIRO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and CSIRO identities.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding SARAO')" data-page-id="381891619"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Co-branding with SARAO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and SARAO identities.</span></span></a></li></ul></section></div></div><aside class="landing-rail" aria-label="Help with this section"><div class="rail-guides"><h2 class="rail-title">Before you start</h2><details class="rail-item" data-kind="info"><summary><span class="rail-label">Working with partner brands</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><section class="landing-note"><p>Use the current guidance for the specific partner and application. Do not assemble a new logo lock-up from memory.</p><p class="rail-links"><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding CSIRO')" class="">CSIRO co-branding</a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding SARAO')" class="">SARAO co-branding</a></p></section></div></details><details class="rail-item" data-kind="ask"><summary><span class="rail-label">Need a second pair of eyes?</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><aside class="next-step"><div><p>Include the draft, intended use and partner requirements.</p></div><p class="rail-links"><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="text-link">Ask about the brand <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></aside></div></details></div></aside></div>
#elseif($page.id.toString() == "381891610")
<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Practical application</span><p>Use the existing templates and artwork to keep your work recognisably SKAO.</p></div></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>A quick self-check</h2><ul><li>Logo: supplied artwork, correct variant, clear space and original proportions.</li><li>Type: Noto Sans, with Verdana as fallback.</li><li>Colour: the sourced palette and readable contrast.</li><li>Images: relevant to the message, with asset-specific credits and permissions.</li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Start from existing material</h2><p>Choose a template rather than rebuilding the layout.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Slide Decks & Presentations')" class="text-link">Find a template</a></aside><nav class="page-pager" aria-label="Previous and next in Brand"><a class="pager-prev" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Colour Palette and Typography')" rel="prev"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span>Colours and typography</a><a class="pager-next" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding CSIRO')" rel="next">Co-branding with CSIRO<span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Brand"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Brand</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Brand Guidelines')">Brand guidance <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding CSIRO')"><strong>Co-branding with CSIRO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and CSIRO identities.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding SARAO')"><strong>Co-branding with SARAO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and SARAO identities.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Logos & Icons')"><strong>Logos and icons</strong><span>Use supplied artwork unchanged. Choose the variant for your background and output.</span></a></div></nav>
