d in Practice')" rel="next">Apply the brand<span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Brand"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Brand</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Brand Guidelines')">Brand guidance <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Brand in Practice')"><strong>Apply the brand</strong><span>Use the existing templates and artwork to keep your work recognisably SKAO.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding CSIRO')"><strong>Co-branding with CSIRO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and CSIRO identities.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding SARAO')"><strong>Co-branding with SARAO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and SARAO identities.</span></a></div></nav>
