es<span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Presentations"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Presentations</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Slide Decks & Presentations')">Prepare a presentation <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Partner templates')"><strong>Partner templates</strong><span>Presentation templates for joint work with SKAO partners.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'About SKAO Master Deck')"><strong>Approved slide decks</strong><span>Decks approved by Communications to reuse and adapt. Find one by topic, event or speaker, look inside it, then download it.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Construction overview')"><strong>Construction overview</strong><span>Where construction of the two telescopes stands. Choose a telescope for its team’s progress slides.</span></a></div></nav>
