<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Media in Canto</span><p>Find existing footage or animation before requesting a new production.</p></div><a href="https://skao.canto.global/v/SKAOStaff" class="button">Open the Canto library <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="media-handoff"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><h2>Search in the source library</h2><p>Search for the topic or event and filter for video.</p></div></div><section class="canto-show" data-canto="video videos" hidden aria-labelledby="show-video"><div class="canto-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">From Canto</p><h2 id="show-video">In the staff media library</h2></div></div><div class="show-stage" aria-roledescription="carousel"><ul class="show-slides" aria-live="off"></ul><div class="show-controls"><button type="button" class="show-prev" aria-label="Previous image"><span aria-hidden="true">‹</span></button><button type="button" class="show-play" aria-label="Pause slideshow" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><button type="button" class="show-next" aria-label="Next image"><span aria-hidden="true">›</span></button></div></div><div class="show-dots" role="group" aria-label="Choose an image"></div><div class="show-foot"><p class="show-note">A few of the approved images in the library. Open Canto to search everything, see each credit and download.</p></div></section><section class="reading-section"><h2>Before using an asset</h2><ul><li>Read the credit, copyright and usage information on the asset.</li><li>Check that it suits your intended audience and use. Availability alone is not permission for every use.</li><li>Choose an appropriate download format; keep the credit with your working file.</li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Can’t find or access the material?</h2><p>Include your search terms, intended use and the link or error shown.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Canto DAM Access')" class="text-link">Get help