<div class="landing-layout"><div class="landing-main"><div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Creative support for events</span><p>Start with the audience, purpose and use date. Reuse existing material before commissioning something new.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'FAQ')" class="button">Brief the creative work</a></div><div class="directory"><section class="dir-group" id="materials"><h2>Materials</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Stand Design and Materials')" data-page-id="381891649"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Stands and merchandise</strong><span>Use the event kit and existing designs before briefing anything new.</span></span></a></li></ul></section></div><section class="reading-section lead-times" id="lead-times" data-landing-main><h2>How much notice we need</h2><p>Minimum lead times, counted back from the day you need it. The earlier you get in touch, the more we can do.</p><table class="lead-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">What you need</th><th scope="col">Lead time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Standard print: flyers, posters and banners</td><td>2–3 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Event photography or video</td><td>3–4 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Merchandise and giveaways</td><td>4–6 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Bespoke gifts or branded clothing</td><td>6–8 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Animation and video production</td><td>6–8 weeks, depending on complexity</td></tr><tr><td>Bespoke production, such as an exhibition stand</td><td>8–10 weeks or more</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="quiet-note">Short notice can limit what’s possible and add supplier costs. If it’s urgent, ask anyway and we’ll tell you what we can do.</p></section><section class="reading-section request-flow" id="how-a-request-runs" data-landing-main><h2>How a request runs</h2><ol class="guide-steps"><li><h3>Ask through the Comms helpdesk</h3><p>Use the <a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="">Comms helpdesk <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> and say what the event is, when and where it’s happening, who it’s for and what you need. The more detail, the quicker we can start.</p></li><li><h3>Talk it through</h3><p>We arrange a short chat to agree the scope, timings and costs. Production costs usually come from your team’s budget, so have the cost centre and budget approval ready.</p></li><li><h3>Review the drafts</h3><p>We share first drafts for your feedback. One or two rounds of changes are usually included.</p></li><li><h3>Final approval</h3><p>Communications signs off all event materials before they’re printed, published or handed out. High-profile events can take a little longer here.</p></li><li><h3>Production and delivery</h3><p>We produce the work and prepare it for the Events and Logistics teams, who deliver it. Give them accurate dates, the delivery address and an on-site contact.</p></li></ol></section></div><aside class="landing-rail" aria-label="Help with this section"><div class="rail-guides"><h2 class="rail-title">Before you start</h2><details class="rail-item" data-kind="info"><summary><span class="rail-label">Who does what</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><div class="responsibility-split"><section><h2>Creative materials</h2><p>Presentation design, stand graphics, print, signage or video within an agreed brief.</p></section><section><h2>Event organisation</h2><p>Registration, attendance, travel, staffing and logistics remain with the events team.</p></section></div></div></details><details class="rail-item" data-kind="check"><summary><span class="rail-label">Confirm with the responsible teams</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><section class="landing-note"><section class="reading-section"><ul><li>Venue and supplier specifications, dimensions and delivery requirements.</li><li>Content owner, proof reviewer and budget approval.</li><li>Supplier lead time and the final artwork deadline.</li><li>Applicable safety requirements with the event organiser and HSSE.</li></ul></section></section></div></details><details class="rail-item" data-kind="info"><summary><span class="rail-label">Event safety</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><section class="reading-section"><p>The event organiser and the SKAO HSSE team confirm safety requirements and approvals. Include any design or material needs in the creative brief.</p><p class="rail-links"><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/298" class="">Open the HSSE helpdesk <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></section></div></details></div></aside></div>
