<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Concept development</span><p>Use the current SKAO AI policy and approved tools before starting a task.</p></div></div></ul></section><!--/pending--><ol class="guide-steps"><li><h3>Check the material is suitable</h3><p>Only use material the approved service is cleared for, and only data the SKAO AI policy allows. Never upload confidential or personal material.</p></li><li><h3>Use it for concepts</h3><p>AI imagery is good for exploring ideas. Keep it clearly separate from photography and from verified scientific images, so nobody mistakes one for the other.</p></li><li><h3>Check before it goes into a deliverable</h3><p>Verify accuracy, rights and suitability before generated imagery is used in finished work.</p></li></ol><p class="quiet-note">Tool availability, model versions and credit allocations are not confirmed by this page. Check the current approved service and account.</p><nav class="page-pager" aria-label="Previous and next in How-to guides"><a class="pager-prev" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Accessibility Guidelines')" rel="prev"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span>Accessibility checks</a></nav><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in How-to guides"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in How-to guides</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Self-Service Guides')">Self-service guides <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Making Your Own Poster')"><strong>Prepare a poster</strong><span>Most of the work on a poster happens before you open a template: knowing the size you need and the one thing you want people to remember.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Preparing Files for Print')"><strong>Prepare files for print</strong><span>Every supplier and product is a little different, so set up and export your file to the supplier’s specification rather than a one-size-fits-all setting.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Print Supplier Contacts')"><strong>Work with print suppliers</strong><span>Communications can recommend trusted print suppliers for your location and the kind of job you have.</span></a></div></nav>
