<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Find and use media</span><p>Canto is the SKAO’s media library. Browse and download approved photos, video and artwork, with the credit and usage notes for each one.</p></div><a href="https://skao.canto.global/v/SKAOStaff" class="button">Open the Canto library <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>First time in Canto?</h2><ol><li>Open the Canto library and choose <strong>Register Now</strong>.</li><li>Register with your SKAO email address.</li><li>Once your account is active, sign in with the same details each time.</li></ol></section><section class="reading-section"><h2>Find, check, download</h2><ol><li>Search for a subject, event or location, or browse the albums.</li><li>Open an asset to read its credit, usage notes and download options.</li><li>Download the version you need and keep the credit with your work.</li></ol></section><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>I can’t sign in or download a file</summary><div><p>Send the page or asset link and the message you see through <a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="">the Comms helpdesk</a>. Never include your password.</p></div></details><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>I want to add material to Canto</summary><div><p>Uploading has its own route. <a href="$link.page('CRH', 'FAQ')#share-photos" class="">See how to share photos or video</a>.</p></div></details><nav class="page-pager" aria-label="Previous and next in Photos and video"><span></span><a class="pager-next" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Video & Animation')" rel="next">Video and animation<span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Photos and video"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Photos and video</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Photography Media')">Photos and video <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Video & Animation')"><strong>Video and animation</strong><span>Find existing footage or animation before requesting a new production.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Image Usage Guidelines')"><strong>Use and credit imagery</strong><span>Read the information on the individual asset before reusing it.</span></a></div></nav>
