<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Production handoff</span><p>Communications can recommend trusted print suppliers for your location and the kind of job you have.</p></div><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="button">Ask for a supplier recommendation <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><ol class="guide-steps"><li><h3>Ask us for a recommendation</h3><p>Tell us where you are and where the items need to go, what you need printed, its size and quantity, and your deadline and budget. We’ll suggest suppliers that suit the job.</p></li><li><h3>Follow the purchasing process</h3><p>Check which procurement rules apply with the responsible team, and agree who gets the quote, who approves the spend and who places the order.</p></li><li><h3>Agree sign-off and dates</h3><p>Decide who signs off the content and the final proof, and agree production and delivery dates with the supplier before you commit.</p></li><li><h3>Prepare the files</h3><p>Ask the supplier for their specification and set up your artwork to match. <a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Preparing Files for Print')" class="">Prepare files for print</a> walks through it.</p></li></ol><nav class="page-pager" aria-label="Previous and next in How-to guides"><a class="pager-prev" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Preparing Files for Print')" rel="prev"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span>Prepare files for print</a><a class="pager-next" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Accessibility Guidelines')" rel="next">Accessibility checks<span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in How-to guides"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in How-to guides</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Self-Service Guides')">Self-service guides <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Accessibility Guidelines')"><strong>Accessibility checks</strong><span>Accessible work is easier for everyone to read. Build it in as you go, then check the file you actually share.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Adobe Firefly')"><strong>Using AI image tools</strong><span>Use the current SKAO AI policy and approved tools before starting a task.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Making Your Own Poster')"><strong>Prepare a poster</strong><span>Most of the work on a poster happens before you open a template: knowing the size you need and the one thing you want people to remember.</span></a></div></nav>
