dy have.">Common questions</a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Adobe Firefly')" data-keys="ai firefly generative midjourney chatgpt" data-question="Can I use AI to make images?" data-answer="Check the SKAO AI policy and use only approved tools. Never upload confidential or personal material.">Using AI image tools</a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Print Supplier Contacts')" data-keys="supplier suppliers printer printers printing" data-question="Who should print it?" data-answer="Communications can recommend trusted print suppliers for your location and the kind of job you have.">Work with print suppliers</a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Stand Design and Materials')" data-keys="stand stands booth exhibition merchandise merch swag giveaway giveaways" data-question="Do we have a stand or merchandise?" data-answer="Check the existing stand kit, designs and stock on Stands and merchandise before briefing anything new.">Stands and merchandise</a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'About SKAO Master Deck')" data-keys="talk talks speaker speakers deck decks reuse" data-question="Where are slides I can reuse?" data-answer="Approved slide decks has decks Communications has approved for reuse, including talks given by staff.">Approved slide decks</a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Templates & Assets')" data-keys="new latest recent added update updates whats" data-question="What’s new in the Hub?" data-answer="Latest files lists every new and updated file, newest first.">Latest files</a></div><div class="search-fallback"><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Templates & Assets')">Browse templates and assets <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'FAQ')">Ask for help <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></dialog><dialog id="welcomeDialog" class="welcome-dialog" aria-labelledby="welcomeTitle" aria-describedby="welcomeText"><div class="welcome-art" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div><button type="button" class="welcome-x" data-welcome-close ar